# 057 · Finalize a champion into reviewable branches

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [later](../roadmap.md#later)

## What

Split a champion's kept changes into separate branches that a project can review and merge upstream.

## Why

A champion is many changes. A project wants to review them one at a time.

## Done when

- [ ] A champion splits into branches that each build and pass the kit.

